WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
Hey, everybody.

2
00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.320
Welcome to the podcast.

3
00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.870
